      */}
      <p>
        <strong>The badge is a circle, a coloured ring, and the notation inside it.</strong> The
        notation is centred on both axes, set in a monospace face, with the editor's mark as a
        superscript. Render badges at whatever size suits your layout; legibility of the
        notation is the only requirement.
